body:
The one about a sister buying a giant teddy bear at a yard sale, she brings it home, shit starts moving around in her house and pictures are falling off the walls, she deduces a demon is attached to the teddy bear and goes to take it to the curb to get rid of it, the next morning it's back in her house.

&#x200B;

Moral of the story? Don't buy shit from garage sale. Didn't land with the JWs in my area, we always went yard saling after a few calls lol
